  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to Sustain a Learning Network and Scale the Labour Market Inclusion of Newcomers in the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is intended to assist the Netherlands in a two-fold approach that will complement the already achieved work towards the development of a learning network to facilitate knowledge-sharing for more successful implementations of projects related to labour market integration of permit holders. The project will bring together and build capacity of relevant national level stakeholders involved in the Dutch Taskforce for the integration of newcomers in the labour market in the Netherlands and provide technical assistance to improve the Netherlands&apos; ability to support the set-up and scaling of sustainable labour market integration projects.</narrative>
  </description>
